  "title": "Faq And Objections — FAQ 1: Prepayment Penalties",
  "content": "## FAQ 1: Prepayment Penalties\nQuestion: Are there prepayment penalties if a borrower settles the loan early?\nAnswer: Absolutely not. All Darwix Commercial Term Loans and Revolving Lines of Credit have zero prepayment penalties. Borrowers can pay off the full balance at any time and receive a discount on unaccrued interest charges.",
